    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a contact form classification assistant.\n\nYour job is to classify the submitted contact into exactly ONE of these categories:\n\n- potential_client\n- hiring\n- general_inquiry\n- spam\n\nDefinitions:\n\npotential_client = The person appears interested in hiring, buying, requesting, or discussing professional services.\n\nhiring = The person is contacting us about a job opportunity, recruitment, employment, interview, or freelance work.\n\ngeneral_inquiry = A legitimate message that does not clearly represent a potential client or hiring opportunity.\n\nspam = Promotional spam, scams, irrelevant automated messages, or clearly unwanted content.\n\nReturn ONLY the category name. Do not explain your answer.\n\nContact information:\n\nName: {{ $json.body.name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.body.email }}\nSubject: {{ $json.body.subject }}\nMessage: {{ $json.body.message }}",
        "options": {}
      },
